  "display_title": "A Mouthful of Sweet Cream Baguette",
  "description": "Roah Egleydon is an avid lover of bread, so when a conference takes her to the home of the famous Everrose Bakery, she is determined to get her hands on some delicious baked goods. After a day of waiting in line in the sweltering sun, she finally makes it to the bakery, only to find them all sold out! That's when she meets Klimt, a mysterious, sexy baker who offers her a sample of his sweet cream baguette. Roah is intrigued by this handsome stranger, but is she biting off more than she can chew?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
